================================================================================
Summary of Key Terms (Non-Commercial Requirement / 非商业许可摘要)
================================================================================

You are free to:
- Use & Share: Copy, install, and redistribute this work for personal gameplay
  and non-commercial community sharing.
- Adapt: Remix, transform, and build upon the material for non-commercial purposes.

Under the following mandatory terms:
1. Attribution (署名): You must give clear credit to the original author
   ("Innateyi / kkowoUI"), link to the original repository
   (https://github.com/Innateyi/kkowoUI), and indicate if changes were made.
2. NonCommercial (非商业性使用): You may NOT use this project, any part of it,
   or any repackaged/bundled version for commercial purposes. Prohibited uses
   include, without limitation:
   - Selling or reselling this addon or any addon pack containing it (e.g., on
     Taobao, Xianyu, Weidian, Patreons, or paid marketplaces);
   - Distributing behind paywalls, paid memberships, paid QQ/Discord/WeChat
     groups, or paid download links;
   - Bundling into any commercial service, boosting service, or paid client.
   (Also required by Blizzard Entertainment's World of Warcraft UI Add-On
   Development Policy: all Add-Ons must be distributed completely free of charge.)
3. ShareAlike (相同方式共享): If you remix, transform, or build upon this work
   and distribute it publicly, you must distribute your contributions under the
   same CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 license.

中文简要说明：
- 允许个人免费游玩、学习及非商业性质的社区分享（须保留原作者 Innateyi / kkowoUI
  署名与本仓库链接，若修改需注明，且二次公开分发须继续采用相同 CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 协议）。
- 严禁任何形式的商业用途，包括但不限于：在淘宝/闲鱼/微店等平台售卖或搭售整合包、
  设置付费群/付费会员/赞助解锁下载链接、捆绑商业服务分发等。

